{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Far be it from me to do this.</b> That I would be the agent to exact punishment from you for your earlier sins — as in the matter of מֵרְשָׁעִים יֵצֵא רֶשַׁע (1 Samuel 24:14) — so that my hand would not be upon you. I will not take a slave, nor will I punish anyone other than the one who has sinned against me now, in this matter alone. End of parashat Mikeitz."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:30.381264781Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}